"lines": [
"Flight MH370 vanished with 239 people aboard. Yet the silent jet kept answering a satellite. Seven times.",
"At 1:19 a.m., the cockpit radioed: 'Good night, Malaysian three seven zero.'",
"Two minutes later, the transponder went dark.",
"But military radar kept watching. The jet turned back across Malaysia.",
"An hour later, it slipped off radar.",
"Then a ground station in Perth pinged it by satellite. The jet answered.",
"Each reply gave only a distance: a ring on the map.",
"The seventh reply, at 8:19 a.m., was the last.",
"Its ring crossed the southern Indian Ocean.",
"In 2015, part of its wing washed up on R\u00e9union Island.",
"Searches swept over 120,000 square kilometres of seafloor. Nothing.",
"Malaysia has extended the hunt to June 2027.",
"Nobody explained it."
